 =?UTF-8?q?=E2=80=94=20stock=20ArduPlane=20against=20the=20rotanimb01=20ha?=
 =?UTF-8?q?rness?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Full ArduPlane on the Nucleo-F767ZI (2 MB), sensors on SPI3 (BMI088 +
BMP388 + RM3100, MODE0 SPIDEVs so the emulated and real stacks both
work), PWM 1-8 on TIM3/TIM4, ADC fully disabled for the bench, 8 MHz
MCO HSE bypass, SERIAL0 on the user OTG USB. CAN1 on PD0/PD1 for the
harness's DroneCAN GPS/airspeed feed (runtime: CAN_P1_DRIVER 1,
GPS_TYPE 9, ARSPD_TYPE 8). Bootloader owns flash 0..96K, app at
0x08018000; storage in flash sectors 1-2.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
